build/

# The vendored engine is committed on purpose, even though it is build output: this repo cannot build it (the source lives in the editor repo) so an unversioned assets/build means a fresh clone ships a plugin whose animations silently never run. The `build/` rule above matches a directory of that name at any depth, so it has to be re-included by name.
!assets/build/

log/
